      "end_time": 321.31
    },
    {
      "text": "I think they've gone home for the day.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 322.65,
      "end_time": 324.47
    },
    {
      "text": "Are the others on a sales call?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 331.49,
      "end_time": 333.51
    },
    {
      "text": "So are they both not here?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 333.81,
      "end_time": 335.35
    },
    {
      "text": "I think so, no.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 336.17,
      "end_time": 342.298
    },
    {
      "text": "Just thinking if there's any major updates, to be honest, TST is the big major update, and there's a bunch of interesting in it now, which is good.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 342.354,
      "end_time": 349.95
    },
    {
      "text": "I asked Stuart if he'd spoken to them before, because I know they've had an offer, and I'm not sure if we have the name of the offer.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 350.93,
      "end_time": 358.79
    },
    {
      "text": "You know what I mean?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 360.21,
      "end_time": 361.154
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not sure we know who the potential acquirer was.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 361.242,
      "end_time": 364.458
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe habas in 2026.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 364.554,
      "end_time": 369.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 370.42,
      "end_time": 375.14
    },
    {
      "text": "Because he did imply that he's been speaking to a lot of different companies.",
