      "start_time": 375.18,
      "end_time": 379.308
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 379.484,
      "end_time": 380.012
    },
    {
      "text": "It sounds like he may have already spoken to them.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 380.036,
      "end_time": 382.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Andy on the call or just us?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 388.34,
      "end_time": 390.4
    },
    {
      "text": "He should be and is not yet on call.",
