      "start_time": 392.66,
      "end_time": 395.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 396.87,
      "end_time": 397.39
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh, I mean, I gotta go at the top of the hour.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 397.43,
      "end_time": 400.622
    },
    {
      "text": "Got a meeting at the top of the hour.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 400.686,
      "end_time": 402.69
    },
    {
      "text": "Um, let's see.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 403.39,
      "end_time": 405.77
    },
    {
      "text": "Anything on my agenda?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 406.87,
      "end_time": 408.89
    },
    {
