      "end_time": 415.37
    },
    {
      "text": "What's that?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 415.75,
      "end_time": 416.77
    },
    {
      "text": "I think you have a question.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 417.35,
      "end_time": 418.654
    },
    {
      "text": "You've asked me a question.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 418.782,
      "end_time": 419.718
    },
    {
      "text": "I haven't answered it yet.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 419.774,
      "end_time": 420.726
    },
    {
      "text": "I bucks.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 420.798,
      "end_time": 421.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, as far as that gaming audience is one, do I.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 425.58,
      "end_time": 429.72
    },
    {
      "text": "That guy.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 430.58,
      "end_time": 431.092
    },
    {
      "text": "That was like ridiculous numbers.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 431.116,
      "end_time": 432.884
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 432.932,
      "end_time": 433.14
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 433.18,
      "end_time": 433.804
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 433.932,
      "end_time": 434.716
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, that was it.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 434.908,
      "end_time": 436.204
    },
    {
      "text": "I was just going to tell him, you know, probably just build it out more.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 436.372,
      "end_time": 439.956
    },
    {
      "text": "But yeah, if there's like a more answer I can.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 440.028,
      "end_time": 442.02
    },
    {
      "text": "More meatier answer I can give them.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 442.06,
      "end_time": 444.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 444.9,
      "end_time": 445.212
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, agencies.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 445.236,
      "end_time": 446.276
    },
    {
      "text": "Xdem is the platform, isn't it?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 446.348,
      "end_time": 449.612
    },
    {
      "text": "That's where that lead should go.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 449.716,
      "end_time": 451.46
    },
    {
      "text": "It should be your business isn't ready to sell yet because it's just you and you won't get a good value for it.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 451.5,
      "end_time": 457.644
    },
    {
      "text": "But if you work with us for the next year or so, we'll be able to build it to the point where you can get a very solid multiple.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 457.692,
      "end_time": 464.868
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, he brings on a couple of new employees, brings on someone who can kind of manage a bit more of the execution.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 465.044,
      "end_time": 473.524
    },
    {
      "text": "He builds out the business development.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 473.572,
      "end_time": 474.996
    },
    {
      "text": "He probably keeps a, say, seven, maybe not 70%, maybe a 50% EBITDA margin.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 475.148,
      "end_time": 480.796
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's say he's doing 3 million revenue, then he's doing instead of the 1.8 he's doing at the moment.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 480.988,
      "end_time": 486.3
    },
    {
      "text": "You boost that out, say he's doing two and a half, for example.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 486.34,
      "end_time": 488.868
    },
    {
      "text": "Then he's got a 1.25 million EBITDA with a management team that can then kind of move with the business, then he can get a multiple of 1.25, whatever it is.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 489.004,
      "end_time": 502.396
    },
    {
      "text": "If it's four times multiple, then he's got a business worth 6 million.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 502.428,
      "end_time": 505.532
    },
    {
      "text": "At the moment, he doesn't have a business worth anything because no one will buy it in its current state.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 505.596,
      "end_time": 510.37
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the way I would probably be selling that.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 512.35,
      "end_time": 514.486
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you know what I mean?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 514.518,
      "end_time": 515.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me know.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 516.71,
      "end_time": 517.65
    },
    {
      "text": "I think that's probably something that maybe is worth handing over to Andy, because I know he's refining that model at the moment.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 518.03,
      "end_time": 526.494
    },
    {
      "text": "So it might be a good one to pitch on.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 526.542,
      "end_time": 528.382
    },
    {
      "text": "But I do think that he is a good target because he's making loads of money and wants to, wants to, wants to sell at some point.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 528.566,
      "end_time": 535.922
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 535.986,
      "end_time": 536.59
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that's good.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 539.61,
      "end_time": 541.498
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 541.674,
      "end_time": 542.202
    },
    {
      "text": "And the other one, too.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 542.266,
      "end_time": 543.258
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is just like a, I got a couple minutes here, but kind of like a level 102 question, finance question.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 543.354,
      "end_time": 552.322
    },
    {
      "text": "What is, sometimes I get this where like, oh, are you talking about.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 552.466,
      "end_time": 557.49
    },
    {
      "text": "It's like there's different levels of, like, looking at the profitability.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 557.53,
      "end_time": 561.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Like, they'd be like, oh, you talking about Ebitda?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 561.56,
      "end_time": 562.864
    },
    {
      "text": "Or like, or like, gross margin?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 562.912,
      "end_time": 564.352
    },
    {
      "text": "Or.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 564.416,
      "end_time": 564.712
    },
    {
      "text": "It's like, to me, it's, you know, again, you know, there's my ignorance, but, you know, I know there's, generally speaking, there's different ways to kind of like, play with the numbers, but it's like, what are these different, it's like, to me, it's like operating expenses or, you know, I don't know.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 564.776,
      "end_time": 581.528
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know if I'm, if I need to work on the question.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 581.544,
      "end_time": 584.248
    },
    {
      "text": "There's probably four lines that you need to worry about.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 584.384,
      "end_time": 586.76
    },
    {
      "text": "One of them is revenue, another is gross profit.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 586.8,
      "end_time": 589.704
    },
    {
      "text": "And then the final is EBITDA.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 589.792,
      "end_time": 591.62
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't think.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 592.2,
      "end_time": 592.744
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 592.792,
      "end_time": 592.976
    },
    {
      "text": "Like that gross profit versus EBITDA.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 593.008,
      "end_time": 595.48
    },
    {
      "text": "What, you know, what's maybe, maybe net profit as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 595.52,
      "end_time": 598.88
    },
    {
      "text": "So gross profit is anything that you do to manufacture the product.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 599,
      "end_time": 606.18
    },
    {
      "text": "So if you, for an agency, if you buy paper and I crayons for the project, that's part of gross profit.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 606.76,
      "end_time": 618.85
    },
    {
      "text": "Operating expenses is more of just like employee costs.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 620.35,
      "end_time": 625.03
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, theoretically, if you work on a project, you're supposed to be part of a gross profit or cost of goods sold in the agency side.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 625.19,
      "end_time": 638.89
    },
    {
      "text": "If you are a contractor, you get put in gross profit, and the normal regular full time employees are put in, in the operating expense.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 639.6,
      "end_time": 652.18
    },
    {
      "text": "So we really don't focus that much on gross profit.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 653,
      "end_time": 658.408
    },
    {
      "text": "We really just focus on operating profit.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 658.544,
      "end_time": 662.66
    },
    {
      "text": "And operating profit is almost identical to agencies as EBITDA.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 664.08,
      "end_time": 671.13
    },
    {
      "text": "So a lot of times they're not going to, if you go cold call, they're going to more so know their operating profit more so than their EBITDA.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 671.63,
      "end_time": 681.53
    },
    {
      "text": "So, but it'll be a close enough benchmark for us to understand.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 682.03,
      "end_time": 687.21
    },
    {
      "text": "And then there is a net profit.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 687.51,
      "end_time": 689.51
    },
    {
      "text": "But that's somewhat, somewhat irrelevant because it gets into tax implications and stuff like that.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 689.55,
      "end_time": 700.162
    },
    {
      "text": "And we really don't go down to that level.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 700.186,
      "end_time": 703.914
    },
    {
      "text": "We usually look more at the operating profit.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 703.962,
      "end_time": 707.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, the other factor for operating profit that is a little different from the EBITDA is the interest expense.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 708.29,
      "end_time": 715.45
    },
    {
      "text": "But a lot of companies we have don't really have a lot of interest expense.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 715.49,
      "end_time": 719.058
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's why the operating profit is usually close to the EBITDA number.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 719.114,
      "end_time": 724.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 726.18,
      "end_time": 727.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So when it comes to valuations, it's done predominantly off revenue and EBITDA.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 727.86,
      "end_time": 733.32
    },
    {
      "text": "And the way it goes is you take your revenue, which is the amount of money you brought in, you take off the costs that it took to bring in that revenue that gets your gross profit.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 734.18,
      "end_time": 744.316
    },
    {
      "text": "You take off the costs that are there, whether or not you make the revenue, which is salaries, operating expenses, then you get to operating profit.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 744.388,
      "end_time": 752.492
    },
    {
      "text": "And in this, in agency world, that's the same as EBITDa.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 752.556,
      "end_time": 756.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Pretty much.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 756.34,
      "end_time": 757.16
    },
    {
      "text": "But multiple is always going to be off Ebitda.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 759.14,
      "end_time": 761.5
    },
    {
      "text": "So in what context have you been asked about what kind of line you would do that off as a multiple?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 761.54,
      "end_time": 769.804
    },
    {
      "text": "No, just in general, when I ask them, like, oh, you know, trying to get the numbers, like, revenue and EBItda.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 769.852,
      "end_time": 773.692
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, you're talking about, like, gross profit.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 773.756,
      "end_time": 775.316
    },
    {
      "text": "And I've heard, like, three different.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 775.388,
      "end_time": 777.116
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm just like, dude, just like, how much money are you making off of this?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 777.188,
      "end_time": 780.476
    },
    {
      "text": "You know?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 780.508,
      "end_time": 781.036
    },
    {
      "text": "But.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 781.148,
      "end_time": 781.492
    },
    {
      "text": "So the reason that they're doing that is probably because they're not making very much money.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 781.556,
      "end_time": 785.436
    },
    {
      "text": "Generally speaking, people won't give you EBITDA numbers because it makes their business look bad.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 785.548,
      "end_time": 790.548
    },
    {
      "text": "So the way to do it is you ask for their EBITda, and if they give you a number other than that, then you kind of say, yeah, it's a good point.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 790.644,
      "end_time": 800.572
    },
    {
      "text": "How do you.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 800.636,
      "end_time": 801.1
    },
    {
      "text": "How do you get that information out of them as to how profitable they are when they're telling you different numbers, but ibadah is the one you really want, I think.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 801.14,
      "end_time": 809.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Right?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 810.11,
      "end_time": 810.494
    },
    {
      "text": "It's really cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 810.542,
      "end_time": 811.654
    },
    {
      "text": "I gotta hop off, guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 811.782,
      "end_time": 813.31
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorry, David.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 813.43,
      "end_time": 813.958
    },
    {
      "text": "I gotta hop off.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 813.974,
      "end_time": 814.646
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 814.718,
      "end_time": 815.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you ever follow up with Simona?",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 816.27,
      "end_time": 818.358
    },
    {
      "text": "Or if you can.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 818.534,
      "end_time": 819.262
    },
    {
      "text": "No, not after.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 819.326,
      "end_time": 820.57
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you want me to?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 821.71,
      "end_time": 822.782
    },
    {
      "text": "Or.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 822.806,
      "end_time": 823.23
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, just send her a quick note.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 823.35,
      "end_time": 825.03
    },
    {
      "text": "Just like what?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 825.19,
      "end_time": 825.822
    },
    {
      "text": "Just checking in, like, hey, how you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 825.846,
      "end_time": 827.03
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 827.07,
      "end_time": 828.398
    },
    {
      "text": "Good courtesy.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 828.574,
      "end_time": 829.718
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 829.894,
      "end_time": 830.546
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, sounds good.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 830.678,
      "end_time": 831.866
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll do.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 831.938,
      "end_time": 832.354
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 832.402,
      "end_time": 832.698
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, guys, I gotta go let Andy know I got a call.",
      "speaker_name": "Ramón Avila",
      "start_time": 832.754,
      "end_time": 836.594
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, should we all bounce?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 836.682,
      "end_time": 838.47
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I just think.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 840.77,
      "end_time": 842.33
    },
    {
      "text": "Just give us.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 842.49,
      "end_time": 843.434
    },
    {
      "text": "Send Andy an update with the habas and the other.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 843.482,
      "end_time": 846.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I'll do it.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 847.73,
      "end_time": 849.482
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll do a.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 849.546,
      "end_time": 850.05
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, no, all right, cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 850.09,
      "end_time": 854.034
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks, guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 854.162,
      "end_time": 854.858
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks, guys.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 854.954,
      "end_time": 855.586
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 855.658,
      "end_time": 855.994
    },
    {
      "text": "Peace and thanks.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 856.042,
      "end_time": 856.72
    }
  ],
